  "_comment": "Properties the API returns that the official spec omits, found with audit-live. Keyed by operationId, then by the path of the object to add them to: '' is the response (each item, for an array response), 'a.b' descends through properties, 'a[]' into array items. Existing properties are never replaced. Report 'properties' holds the union of every report type's settings, all optional; keys a type adds that aren't listed stay in AdditionalProperties.",
